          "name": "startLiveTranscription",
          "signature": "startLiveTranscription(): ExecutedResult",
          "async": true,
          "parameters": [],
          "returns": {
            "type": "ExecutedResult"
          },
          "description": "Start live transcription.\n\n``` javascript\nzmClient.on('caption-message',(payload)=>{\n console.log(`receive new transcription:${payload.text}`)\n});\n\nconst lttClient = zmClient.getLiveTranscriptionClient();\nlttClient.startLiveTranscription();\n```"
        },
